This boy

4
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:19,330
looks like he's gonna blow up.

5
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,470
My boy here is ready to crash 'em.

6
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:22,000
I'm sorry, Cher,

7
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,020
for being late.

8
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:23,890
Acting

9
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:25,810
is not about putting on faces

10
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,430
and relying on the emotions on set.

11
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:30,000
I don't care why you joined the industry,

12
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,159
but I hate how unprofessional you are.

13
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:35,840
Excuse me, coming through!

14
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:36,960
- Coming through.
- Wan!!

15
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,440
Look right here.

16
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,240
Blow on my finger.

17
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:52,760
[He plays Sky in
'The Deep Between Us'; please adore him]

18
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:54,800
Whoa, that kid knows the ropes!

19
00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:58,120
Look at him stealing the thunder...

20
00:01:07,470 --> 00:01:08,970
All he does is plan these stunts

21
00:01:10,289 --> 00:01:12,480
instead of spending time
reading the script or the novel.

22
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,560
When it's time to act, he can't do shit.

23
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,100
Mm...

24
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,800
So what do you want me to do?

25
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,560
Drop him.

26
00:01:25,770 --> 00:01:26,480
Easier that way.

27
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,560
Our work can't be wrecked, you know.

28
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:33,050
Okay.

29
00:01:34,370 --> 00:01:35,600
I'm calling a meeting tomorrow.

